{"seq":1,"slug":"aggregation-patterns","title":"聚合分析模式","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/analytical-sql/aggregation-patterns","wordCount":738,"readingTime":3,"html":"<h1 id=\"聚合分析模式\">聚合分析模式</h1><h2 id=\"核心概念\">核心概念</h2><p>SQL 聚合函数是数据分析的基础构建块，从简单的 COUNT/SUM 到复杂的条件聚合、分组集合和多维分析。掌握聚合模式意味着能够用一条 SQL 语句完成原本需要多次查询和程序处理的统计分析任务。高级聚合超越了基本的 GROUP BY，通过 GROUPING SETS、ROLLUP、CUBE 等扩展实现多维度交叉分析。</p>\n<pre class=\"mermaid\" data-diagram-type=\"graph\" data-source=\"graph TB&#10;    A[聚合分析] --&gt; B[基础聚合]&#10;    A --&gt; C[条件聚合]&#10;    A --&gt; D[多维聚合]&#10;    A --&gt; E[近似聚合]&#10;    B --&gt; B1[COUNT/SUM/AVG]&#10;    B --&gt; B2[MIN/MAX/GROUP_CONCAT]&#10;    C --&gt; C1[CASE WHEN + 聚合]&#10;    C --&gt; C2[FILTER 子句]&#10;    D --&gt; D1[GROUPING SETS]&#10;    D --&gt; D2[ROLLUP / CUBE]&#10;    E --&gt; E1[APPROX_COUNT_DISTINCT]&#10;    E --&gt; E2[HyperLogLog]\">graph TB\n    A[聚合分析] --&gt; B[基础聚合]\n    A --&gt; C[条件聚合]\n    A --&gt; D[多维聚合]\n    A --&gt; E[近似聚合]\n    B --&gt; B1[COUNT/SUM/AVG]\n    B --&gt; B2[MIN/MAX/GROUP_CONCAT]\n    C --&gt; C1[CASE WHEN + 聚合]\n    C --&gt; C2[FILTER 子句]\n    D --&gt; D1[GROUPING SETS]\n    D --&gt; D2[ROLLUP / CUBE]\n    E --&gt; E1[APPROX_COUNT_DISTINCT]\n    E --&gt; E2[HyperLogLog]</pre><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>聚合类型</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n<th>性能影响</th>\n<th>数据库支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>基础聚合</td>\n<td>简单统计</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>所有数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>条件聚合</td>\n<td>行转列/透视</td>\n<td>低</td>\n<td>所有数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>GROUPING SETS</td>\n<td>多维报表</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL/MySQL 8+</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROLLUP</td>\n<td>层级小计</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>所有主流数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CUBE</td>\n<td>所有组合</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL/Oracle</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>近似聚合</td>\n<td>超大数据集</td>\n<td>极低</td>\n<td>BigQuery/ClickHouse</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"条件聚合与行转列\">条件聚合与行转列</h2><p>条件聚合是 SQL 中最强大的分析技巧之一，通过 CASE WHEN 表达式在聚合函数内部实现条件过滤，实现行转列（Pivot）和多维度统计：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    department,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS total_employees,&#10;    COUNT(CASE WHEN salary &gt; 100000 THEN 1 END) AS high_salary_count,&#10;    ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN gender = &#39;M&#39; THEN salary END), 2) AS avg_male_salary,&#10;    ROUND(AVG(CASE WHEN gender = &#39;F&#39; THEN salary END), 2) AS avg_female_salary,&#10;    SUM(CASE WHEN hire_date &gt;= DATE_TRUNC(&#39;year&#39;, CURRENT_DATE)&#10;             THEN 1 ELSE 0 END) AS new_hires_this_year&#10;FROM employees&#10;GROUP BY department;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    department,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_employees,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100000</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> high_salary_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gender </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'M'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_male_salary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gender </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'F'</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> THEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_female_salary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">CASE</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> WHEN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hire_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> DATE_TRUNC(</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'year'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, CURRENT_DATE)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">             THEN</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 1</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ELSE</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 0</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> END</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> new_hires_this_year</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employees</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> department;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>PostgreSQL 提供了更简洁的 FILTER 子句语法：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    department,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS total,&#10;    COUNT(*) FILTER (WHERE salary &gt; 100000) AS high_salary,&#10;    AVG(salary) FILTER (WHERE gender = &#39;M&#39;) AS avg_male_salary,&#10;    AVG(salary) FILTER (WHERE gender = &#39;F&#39;) AS avg_female_salary&#10;FROM employees&#10;GROUP BY department;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    department,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> salary </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 100000</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> high_salary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gender </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'M'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_male_salary,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(salary) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FILTER</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> gender </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">=</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> 'F'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_female_salary</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employees</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> department;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>写法</th>\n<th>可读性</th>\n<th>性能</th>\n<th>数据库支持</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>CASE WHEN + 聚合</td>\n<td>中</td>\n<td>标准</td>\n<td>所有数据库</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>FILTER 子句</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>相同</td>\n<td>PostgreSQL</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>PIVOT 关键字</td>\n<td>高</td>\n<td>优化</td>\n<td>Oracle/SQL Server</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"grouping-sets-与多维分析\">GROUPING SETS 与多维分析</h2><p>GROUPING SETS 允许在一条查询中同时计算多个不同维度组合的聚合结果，ROLLUP 和 CUBE 是其常用的简写形式：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    COALESCE(region, &#39;(全部)&#39;) AS region,&#10;    COALESCE(category, &#39;(全部)&#39;) AS category,&#10;    COALESCE(CAST(EXTRACT(YEAR FROM order_date) AS TEXT), &#39;(全部)&#39;) AS year,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS order_count,&#10;    SUM(amount) AS total_revenue,&#10;    ROUND(AVG(amount), 2) AS avg_order_value&#10;FROM orders&#10;GROUP BY GROUPING SETS (&#10;    (region, category),&#10;    (region),&#10;    (category),&#10;    ()&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(region, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'(全部)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> region,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(category, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'(全部)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COALESCE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">CAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(EXTRACT(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">YEAR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> TEXT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">), </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'(全部)'</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> year</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    ROUND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount), </span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">2</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_order_value</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> GROUPING </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SETS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (region, category),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (region),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    (category),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ()</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>ROLLUP 自动生成层级小计，适合组织结构和时间层级报表：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM order_date) AS year,&#10;    EXTRACT(MONTH FROM order_date) AS month,&#10;    category,&#10;    SUM(amount) AS revenue,&#10;    GROUPING(EXTRACT(YEAR FROM order_date)) AS is_year_total,&#10;    GROUPING(EXTRACT(MONTH FROM order_date)) AS is_month_total,&#10;    GROUPING(category) AS is_category_total&#10;FROM orders&#10;GROUP BY ROLLUP (&#10;    EXTRACT(YEAR FROM order_date),&#10;    EXTRACT(MONTH FROM order_date),&#10;    category&#10;);\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    EXTRACT(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">YEAR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> year</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    EXTRACT(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MONTH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> month</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    category,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revenue,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    GROUPING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(EXTRACT(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">YEAR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_year_total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    GROUPING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(EXTRACT(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MONTH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date)) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_month_total,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    GROUPING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(category) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> is_category_total</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ROLLUP</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    EXTRACT(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">YEAR</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    EXTRACT(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">MONTH</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date),</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    category</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">);</span></span></code></pre></div><p>CUBE 生成所有可能的维度组合，适合需要全面交叉分析的场景：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    region,&#10;    category,&#10;    SUM(amount) AS revenue&#10;FROM orders&#10;GROUP BY CUBE (region, category)&#10;ORDER BY region NULLS LAST, category NULLS LAST;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    region,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    category,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> revenue</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> CUBE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (region, category)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> region </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULLS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">, category </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">NULLS</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> LAST</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>操作</th>\n<th>生成的分组</th>\n<th>分组数量</th>\n<th>适用场景</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>GROUPING SETS</td>\n<td>精确指定</td>\n<td>自定义</td>\n<td>灵活多维</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>ROLLUP(a,b,c)</td>\n<td>(a,b,c),(a,b),(a),()</td>\n<td>n+1</td>\n<td>层级小计</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>CUBE(a,b,c)</td>\n<td>所有子集</td>\n<td>2^n</td>\n<td>全面交叉</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"字符串聚合与数组聚合\">字符串聚合与数组聚合</h2><p>将多行数据聚合为单个字符串或数组是报表和数据展示的常见需求：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    department,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS member_count,&#10;    STRING_AGG(employee_name, &#39;, &#39; ORDER BY hire_date) AS members,&#10;    ARRAY_AGG(DISTINCT skill ORDER BY skill) AS skills,&#10;    STRING_AGG(DISTINCT job_title, &#39; / &#39;) AS positions&#10;FROM employees&#10;JOIN employee_skills USING (employee_id)&#10;GROUP BY department;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    department,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> member_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    STRING_AGG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(employee_name, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">', '</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> hire_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> members,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    ARRAY_AGG(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> skill </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> skill) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> skills,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    STRING_AGG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> job_title, </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">' / '</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> positions</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employees</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">JOIN</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> employee_skills </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">USING</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (employee_id)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> department;</span></span></code></pre></div><div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"typescript\" data-code=\"const stringAggExamples = `&#10;-- MySQL 使用 GROUP_CONCAT&#10;SELECT department,&#10;       GROUP_CONCAT(name ORDER BY name SEPARATOR &#39;, &#39;) AS members&#10;FROM employees&#10;GROUP BY department;&#10;&#10;-- SQLite 使用 GROUP_CONCAT（无 ORDER BY 支持）&#10;SELECT department,&#10;       GROUP_CONCAT(name, &#39;, &#39;) AS members&#10;FROM employees&#10;GROUP BY department;&#10;&#10;-- SQL Server 使用 STRING_AGG（2017+）&#10;SELECT department,&#10;       STRING_AGG(name, &#39;, &#39;) WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY name) AS members&#10;FROM employees&#10;GROUP BY department;&#10;`;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">const</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> stringAggExamples</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> =</span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\"> `</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- MySQL 使用 GROUP_CONCAT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT department,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">       GROUP_CONCAT(name ORDER BY name SEPARATOR ', ') AS members</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM employees</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY department;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- SQLite 使用 GROUP_CONCAT（无 ORDER BY 支持）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT department,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">       GROUP_CONCAT(name, ', ') AS members</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM employees</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY department;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">-- SQL Server 使用 STRING_AGG（2017+）</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">SELECT department,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">       STRING_AGG(name, ', ') WITHIN GROUP (ORDER BY name) AS members</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">FROM employees</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">GROUP BY department;</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">`</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><table>\n<thead>\n<tr>\n<th>函数</th>\n<th>PostgreSQL</th>\n<th>MySQL</th>\n<th>SQL Server</th>\n<th>SQLite</th>\n</tr>\n</thead>\n<tbody><tr>\n<td>字符串聚合</td>\n<td>STRING_AGG</td>\n<td>GROUP_CONCAT</td>\n<td>STRING_AGG</td>\n<td>GROUP_CONCAT</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>数组聚合</td>\n<td>ARRAY_AGG</td>\n<td>JSON_ARRAYAGG</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>JSON_GROUP_ARRAY</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>排序支持</td>\n<td>ORDER BY</td>\n<td>ORDER BY</td>\n<td>WITHIN GROUP</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n<tr>\n<td>去重</td>\n<td>DISTINCT</td>\n<td>DISTINCT</td>\n<td>—</td>\n<td>—</td>\n</tr>\n</tbody></table>\n<h2 id=\"having-与聚合过滤\">HAVING 与聚合过滤</h2><p>HAVING 子句在聚合计算之后进行过滤，是实现&quot;满足条件的分组&quot;查询的核心手段：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"SELECT&#10;    customer_id,&#10;    COUNT(*) AS order_count,&#10;    SUM(amount) AS total_spent,&#10;    AVG(amount) AS avg_order,&#10;    MAX(order_date) AS last_order&#10;FROM orders&#10;WHERE order_date &gt;= CURRENT_DATE - INTERVAL &#39;1 year&#39;&#10;GROUP BY customer_id&#10;HAVING COUNT(*) &gt;= 5&#10;   AND SUM(amount) &gt; 10000&#10;ORDER BY total_spent DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">    customer_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_spent,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_order,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">    MAX</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_date) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> last_order</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_date </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> CURRENT_DATE </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">-</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> INTERVAL </span><span style=\"color:#032F62;--shiki-dark:#9ECBFF\">'1 year'</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">HAVING</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 5</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">   AND</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 10000</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_spent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><p>复杂的聚合过滤可以结合子查询和 CTE 实现更精细的条件：</p>\n<div class=\"code-block-wrapper\" data-lang=\"sql\" data-code=\"WITH customer_stats AS (&#10;    SELECT&#10;        customer_id,&#10;        COUNT(*) AS order_count,&#10;        SUM(amount) AS total_spent,&#10;        AVG(amount) AS avg_order,&#10;        COUNT(DISTINCT category) AS category_count&#10;    FROM orders&#10;    GROUP BY customer_id&#10;)&#10;SELECT *&#10;FROM customer_stats&#10;WHERE order_count &gt; (SELECT AVG(order_count) FROM customer_stats)&#10;  AND category_count &gt;= 3&#10;ORDER BY total_spent DESC;\"><pre class=\"shiki shiki-themes github-light github-dark\" style=\"background-color:#fff;--shiki-dark-bg:#24292e;color:#24292e;--shiki-dark:#e1e4e8\" tabindex=\"0\"><code><span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WITH</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_stats </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    SELECT</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">        customer_id,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">*</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_count,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        SUM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_spent,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(amount) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> avg_order,</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\">        COUNT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DISTINCT</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">AS</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category_count</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> orders</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">    GROUP BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_id</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\"> *</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_stats</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">WHERE</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> order_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">></span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> (</span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">SELECT</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> AVG</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">(order_count) </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">FROM</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> customer_stats)</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">  AND</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> category_count </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">>=</span><span style=\"color:#005CC5;--shiki-dark:#79B8FF\"> 3</span></span>\n<span class=\"line\"><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">ORDER BY</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\"> total_spent </span><span style=\"color:#D73A49;--shiki-dark:#F97583\">DESC</span><span style=\"color:#24292E;--shiki-dark:#E1E4E8\">;</span></span></code></pre></div><h2 id=\"小结\">小结</h2><ul>\n<li>条件聚合（CASE WHEN + 聚合函数）是 SQL 中最灵活的数据透视技巧</li>\n<li>PostgreSQL 的 FILTER 子句提供了更优雅的条件聚合语法</li>\n<li>GROUPING SETS/ROLLUP/CUBE 实现多维交叉分析，减少多次查询</li>\n<li>STRING_AGG/ARRAY_AGG 将多行聚合为字符串或数组，简化报表输出</li>\n<li>HAVING 子句在聚合后过滤分组，配合 CTE 可实现复杂的统计条件</li>\n<li>近似聚合函数在超大数据集上用精度换取数量级的性能提升</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"level":1,"text":"聚合分析模式","id":"聚合分析模式"},{"level":2,"text":"核心概念","id":"核心概念"},{"level":2,"text":"条件聚合与行转列","id":"条件聚合与行转列"},{"level":2,"text":"GROUPING SETS 与多维分析","id":"grouping-sets-与多维分析"},{"level":2,"text":"字符串聚合与数组聚合","id":"字符串聚合与数组聚合"},{"level":2,"text":"HAVING 与聚合过滤","id":"having-与聚合过滤"},{"level":2,"text":"小结","id":"小结"}],"prev":{"title":"查询优化实践","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/performance-tuning/query-optimization"},"next":{"title":"DML 进阶操作","url":"/l-doc-books/h/languages/sql-language/analytical-sql/dml-advanced"}}